terrio-filegdb
Licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

This crate is a port of the relevant parts of GDAL's OpenFileGDB driver. The copyright in the code
it translates remains with its authors, whose notices follow. Each source file derived from GDAL's
source files starts with SPDX headers: the copyright lines of those source files, copied verbatim,
the license that applies, and the files it was translated from.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GDAL (https://github.com/OSGeo/gdal)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Files derived from GDAL source files (ogr/ogrsf_frmts/openfilegdb/):
  crates/terrio-filegdb/src/geometry.rs
  crates/terrio-filegdb/src/lib.rs
  crates/terrio-filegdb/src/shape.rs
  crates/terrio-filegdb/src/spatial_index.rs
  crates/terrio-filegdb/src/table.rs
  crates/terrio-filegdb/src/varint.rs
  crates/terrio-filegdb/src/writer.rs

